      "message": "The two levels of svids[] arrrays is confusing. How about svid_response[] instead?  \n\nAnother option is to combine the identity_data and svid_data structs because they are now both indexed by SOP message type.\n\nSomething like\nstruct sop_discovery_data {\n    struct indentity_data indentity;\n    struct svid_data svid;\n}\n\nstruct pd_discovery {\n    struct sop_discovery_data sop_data[DISCOVERY_TYPE_COUNT];\n}\n\nWDYT?",
